  EnglishText: Name a mistake you made that you would never repeat
  PolishText: "Prosz\u0119 poda\u0107 b\u0142\u0105d, kt\xF3ry Pan/Pani pope\u0142ni\u0142(a)
    i kt\xF3rego ju\u017C nie powt\xF3rzy"
